LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024)
# LAMMPS输入文件示例：使用Martini 3粗粒化力场计算PDMS的均方回转半径
# -----------------------------------------------------
# 1. 初始化设置
# -----------------------------------------------------
units               real
dimension           3
boundary            p p p
atom_style          full

# 读取包含PDMS分子结构的data文件
read_data           pdms_10_hexane.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-2.363 -2.3645 -2.277001) to (121.117 121.1155 121.123)
  4 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  20010 atoms
  scanning bonds ...
  1 = max bonds/atom
